Error [jet.DeepCheckScopeMalformed]: `--deep-checks=tree..run` isn't a deep-check scope.
 Why: A deep-check scope is a package name, then module, type and function names, joined by `.`; each name is letters, digits, `_` and `-`.
 Fix: Write `--deep-checks` for every deep check, or name a scope, such as `--deep-checks=tree.run`.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2119
